<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ca300309b9ae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Pony.ai, an autonomous vehicle startup based in Silicon Valley and Guangzhou, China, is temporarily unable to test driverless vehicles in California after a vehicle crash led the state’s Department of Motor Vehicles to suspend the company’s testing permit." ;
